{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggZyRxhYX1Nqk8fPnxou","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this project. Smoke tests passed.\n\n- **Project:** I created a new project, `ufo` (ID `72a61cf3-…`), as your primary project. I put it at `~/basic-memory-ufo` instead of `~/basic-memory/ufo`, because that path sits inside the existing `main` project and Basic Memory rejects nested projects.\n- **Session profile:** `coding`, with repository `ufo`. There's no git remote, so I used the directory name as you said.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task, and none existed before. The frontmatter is stored as nested objects on disk. The `bm_read` JSON call reports `frontmatter: null`, so the on-disk file was the check I trusted.\n- **Placement:** this is a new project, so I suggested a light starting structure: `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `sessions/` and `notes/`. It's stored as `placementConventions`, and no folders were created.\n- **Smoke tests:** the open-decision query returned cleanly with 0 results. The schema search found all three schemas.\n- **Hook status:** settings were found, with the right project, profile and repository. Lifecycle-event capture is on, and the shared inbox holds 3 pending envelopes with no flush yet. It also reports \"checkpoint on compact: off\", even though I set `preCompactCapture` to `extractive`. I haven't investigated that.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally.\n- **Settings file:** I wrote them to `.claude/settings.local.json` as a personal config, with `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"`. The `.claude/` folder shows as untracked and isn't git-ignored, so add it to `.gitignore` or `.git/info/exclude` if you don't want it committed.\n\nThe proactive-capture behaviour is fixed at session start, so **restart the session** to turn it on. Recall and the PreCompact checkpoint already work in this session.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1025,"cache_read_input_tokens":39943,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1025},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb02920f-aaea-4e3d-9257-30e6e4a2ce8d","uuid":"d675f7a9-ad24-4fb9-bb1f-08af4967eaa3","timestamp":"2026-11-03T19:45:32.779Z","request_id":"req_011CggZyRjofCMDEJG53XmtV"}
